[
  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_14_1",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 14,
    "verse": 1,
    "original": "श्रीभगवानुवाच |\nपरं भूयः प्रवक्ष्यामि ज्ञानानां ज्ञानमुत्तमम् |\nयज्ज्ञात्वा मुनयः सर्वे परां सिद्धिमितो गताः ||१४-१||",
    "transliteration": "śrībhagavānuvāca .\nparaṃ bhūyaḥ pravakṣyāmi jñānānāṃ jñānamuttamam .\nyajjñātvā munayaḥ sarve parāṃ siddhimito gatāḥ ||14-1||",
    "meaning": "14.1 The Blessed Lord said  I will again declare (to thee) that supreme knowledge, the best of all knowledge, having known which all the sages have gone to the supreme perfection after this life.",
