  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_14_2",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 14,
    "verse": 2,
    "original": "इदं ज्ञानमुपाश्रित्य मम साधर्म्यमागताः |\nसर्गेऽपि नोपजायन्ते प्रलये न व्यथन्ति च ||१४-२||",
    "transliteration": "idaṃ jñānamupāśritya mama sādharmyamāgatāḥ .\nsarge.api nopajāyante pralaye na vyathanti ca ||14-2||",
    "meaning": "14.2 They who, having taken refuge in this knowledge, have attained to unity with Me, are neither born at the time of creation nor are they disturbed at the time of dissolution.",
