    "id": "bhagavad-gita_14_3",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 14,
    "verse": 3,
    "original": "मम योनिर्महद् ब्रह्म तस्मिन्गर्भं दधाम्यहम् |\nसम्भवः सर्वभूतानां ततो भवति भारत ||१४-३||",
    "transliteration": "mama yonirmahad brahma tasmingarbhaṃ dadhāmyaham .\nsambhavaḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ tato bhavati bhārata ||14-3||",
    "meaning": "14.3 My womb is the great Brahma; in that I place the germ; thence, O Arjuna, is the birth of all beings.",
