  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_14_4",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 14,
    "verse": 4,
    "original": "सर्वयोनिषु कौन्तेय मूर्तयः सम्भवन्ति याः |\nतासां ब्रह्म महद्योनिरहं बीजप्रदः पिता ||१४-४||",
    "transliteration": "sarvayoniṣu kaunteya mūrtayaḥ sambhavanti yāḥ .\ntāsāṃ brahma mahadyonirahaṃ bījapradaḥ pitā ||14-4||",
    "meaning": "14.4 Whatever forms are produced, O Arjuna, in any womb whatsoever, the great Brahma is their womb and I am the seed-giving father.",
