    "id": "bhagavad-gita_14_5",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 14,
    "verse": 5,
    "original": "सत्त्वं रजस्तम इति गुणाः प्रकृतिसम्भवाः |\nनिबध्नन्ति महाबाहो देहे देहिनमव्ययम् ||१४-५||",
    "transliteration": "sattvaṃ rajastama iti guṇāḥ prakṛtisambhavāḥ .\nnibadhnanti mahābāho dehe dehinamavyayam ||14-5||",
    "meaning": "14.5 Purity, passion and inertia  these alities, O Arjuna, born of Nature, bind fast in the body, the embodied, the indestructible.",
