  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_14_8",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 14,
    "verse": 8,
    "original": "तमस्त्वज्ञानजं विद्धि मोहनं सर्वदेहिनाम् |\nप्रमादालस्यनिद्राभिस्तन्निबध्नाति भारत ||१४-८||",
    "transliteration": "tamastvajñānajaṃ viddhi mohanaṃ sarvadehinām .\npramādālasyanidrābhistannibadhnāti bhārata ||14-8||",
    "meaning": "14.8 But know thou Tamas to be born of ignorance, deluding all embodied beings; it binds fast, O Arjuna, by heedlessness, indolence and sleep.",
