  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_14_10",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 14,
    "verse": 10,
    "original": "रजस्तमश्चाभिभूय सत्त्वं भवति भारत |\nरजः सत्त्वं तमश्चैव तमः सत्त्वं रजस्तथा ||१४-१०||",
    "transliteration": "rajastamaścābhibhūya sattvaṃ bhavati bhārata .\nrajaḥ sattvaṃ tamaścaiva tamaḥ sattvaṃ rajastathā ||14-10||",
    "meaning": "14.10 Now Sattva arises (prevails), O Arjuna, having overpowered Rajas and Tamas; nor Rajas, having overpowered Sattva and Tamas; and now Tamas, having overpowered Sattva and Rajas.",
